# Generated files — the tool that writes them owns their formatting.
#
# CHANGELOG.md is written by release-please and by
# scripts/enrich-release-changelog.mjs, both of which emit `*` list markers.
# Prettier normalizes those to `-`, so without this entry the file churns:
# CI regenerates with `*`, the next local commit that stages the file flips
# every line back to `-`, and the real change hides inside a few hundred
# marker-only diffs. .markdownlintignore already excludes it for the same
# reason; this is the matching half.
CHANGELOG.md

